{"id":"44a6282f-042e-45e6-9e3d-c9e4703768d9","object":"chat.completion","created":1793238733,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<code>\nnote1 = write_note(\n    title=\"DeepInfer config/formatter/stats-queue mechanisms\",\n    content=\"environ.py: EnvVar is a descriptor with __set_name__ registering into _descriptors; __get__ caches into owner.__dict__ so first read wins; exceptions wrapped as type(e)(f'{self.name}: {e}'). Factory methods build config items; rearm(name)/rearm_all() reset cache. New config should be a factory method parsing int and requiring >=32. logger.py: _setup_logger creates _default_handler once (StreamHandler stdout, INFO) and sets a NewLineFormatter(_FORMAT, datefmt, use_color=isatty()). NewLineFormatter.__init__(fmt,datefmt,high_precision,use_color) stores flags; format() calls super().format(record) then aligns multiline using record.message, then colors. init_logger(name) sets DEBUG, propagate True under deepinfer prefix else attaches _default_handler. stats_logger.py: logger=init_logger(__name__); _log_worker(q) iterates iter(q.get,None), optional sleep by rank, for m in msgs: logger.info(m), need_sleep=q.empty(), except traceback.print_exc(). _emit_logs puts msgs on _log_queue. Only change: logger.info(m, extra={'keep_full_message': True}).\",\n    evidence_ids=[\"ev-8554ade850ecb397d235\",\"ev-246c6e73a88cb2c9edc3\",\"ev-ef45633e339c9e5fd82f\",\"ev-d69c220908cefeeae7f2\",\"ev-51e2fa3b9fc1aebe86f3\",\"ev-ddb5be78a5cf6218d616\",\"ev-c8859274b7c70879ff16\",\"ev-5a3c8c1ca1246b61b813\",\"ev-5abfdabfb975754c6683\"],\n    section=\"mechanisms\"\n)\nprint(note1)\n"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8781,"completion_tokens":445,"total_tokens":9226,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5504},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5504,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3277},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}